{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02585","headline":"赋得吴都 · 虞世南","name":"赋得吴都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画野通淮泗，星躔应斗牛。\n玉牒宏图表，黄旗美气浮。\n三分开霸业，万里宅神州。\n高台临茂苑，飞阁跨澄流。\n江涛如素盖，海气似朱楼。\n吴趋自有乐，还似镜中游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}